{"text": "Design-side, I live in Figma. Photoshop and Illustrator I'd call expert after twenty years, and I use InDesign and After Effects too. Dev-side, I'm a React person, I've shipped iOS in Swift, I'm comfortable in AWS, and I write TypeScript, all of it in Git. On the product side, I run Jira end to end, with Confluence for the docs and Slack or Teams to keep everyone talking. A big part is research: interviews, forms, A.B. tests, and workshops. I'll be straight about the edges: on backend work, AI is my pair, and Azure, SQL and Premiere are working knowledge, not mastery. Oh, and the avatar you're talking to? Rive, ElevenLabs, and Claude. I built that too.", "words": [["Design", 0.0], ["side", 0.4], ["I", 1.04], ["live", 1.28], ["in", 1.76], ["Figma", 1.92], ["Photoshop", 2.8], ["and", 3.32], ["Illustrator", 3.44], ["I'd", 4.24], ["call", 4.52], ["expert", 4.72], ["after", 5.28], ["twenty", 5.6], ["years", 5.92], ["and", 6.56], ["I", 6.68], ["use", 6.84], ["InDesign", 7.04], ["and", 7.56], ["After", 7.68], ["Effects", 8.12], ["too", 8.44], ["Dev", 9.12], ["side", 9.424], ["I'm", 10.08], ["a", 10.2], ["React", 10.44], ["person", 10.72], ["I've", 11.36], ["shipped", 11.56], ["iOS", 11.84], ["in", 12.28], ["Swift", 12.48], ["I'm", 13.16], ["comfortable", 13.44], ["in", 13.8], ["AWS", 13.92], ["and", 14.8], ["I", 15.04], ["write", 15.24], ["TypeScript", 15.48], ["all", 16.32], ["of", 16.48], ["it", 16.64], ["in", 16.8], ["Git", 16.96], ["On", 17.68], ["the", 17.8], ["product", 17.92], ["side", 18.24], ["I", 18.84], ["run", 18.96], ["Jira", 19.2], ["end", 19.68], ["to", 19.92], ["end", 20.08], ["with", 20.64], ["Confluence", 20.8], ["for", 21.32], ["the", 21.44], ["docs", 21.52], ["and", 22.0], ["Slack", 22.32], ["or", 22.68], ["Teams", 22.8], ["to", 23.24], ["keep", 23.36], ["everyone", 23.52], ["talking", 23.88], ["A", 24.8], ["big", 25.04], ["part", 25.28], ["is", 25.6], ["research", 25.76], ["interviews", 26.72], ["forms", 27.68], ["A", 28.16], ["B", 28.32], ["